# The Armor's enters ability is independent of the Armor staying around: with the trigger targeting Elvish Mystic on the stack, Bot2
# destroys the Armor with Disenchant. On resolution the Armor is gone, so there is nothing to attach, but the Mystic is still a legal
# target and gains hexproof and indestructible until end of turn. It is a plain 1/1 without flying or the +2/+0, and the Armor is in
# Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Elvish Mystic
Celestial Armor
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Ruby
Disenchant
Plains x15

